# reprepro distributions for the mtroamd apt repo (served from gh-pages at
# https://ag-studio-apps.github.io/mtroamd). Two suites share one repo + one
# signing key:
#
#   stable — production. Only main-ancestor, clean-semver tags publish here.
#            By the branch model (main only advances on an App Store release),
#            this always matches the live iOS app's pinned daemon version.
#   dev    — DEVELOPMENT. develop / -rc / ~dev builds. Public but opt-in and
#            loudly flagged; may break your system. Pairs with TestFlight.
#
# SignWith: yes → sign with the default secret key in the keyring (CI imports
# exactly one: the APT_GPG_KEY secret), so no fingerprint is hardcoded here.
# This file is the canonical template; CI copies it into the gh-pages worktree.

Origin: mtroamd
Label: mtroamd
Codename: stable
Suite: stable
Components: main
Architectures: amd64 arm64 armhf
Description: mtroamd apt repository (stable — production, matches the App Store app)
SignWith: yes

